            <strong class="font-bold">त्रुटी (Error):</strong> जन्म तारीख ही जाहिरातीतील कट-ऑफ तारखेपेक्षा आधीची असणे आवश्यक आहे.
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Results Section (Initially Hidden) -->
        <div
          id="results-section"
          class="hidden mt-8 space-y-6 pt-6 border-t border-border-card dark:border-border-card/30 animate-[fadeInUp_0.5s_ease_forwards]"
        >
          <!-- Main Result Box -->
          <div class="text-center bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/5 to-secondary/5 border border-primary/20 rounded-2xl p-6 relative overflow-hidden">
            <span class="text-[0.65rem] bg-primary/10 text-primary border border-primary/20 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider">
              तुमचे अचूक वय (Your Exact Age)
            </span>
            <div id="main-result-mr" class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black text-text-main mt-3 leading-tight">
              <!-- Marathi result -->
            </div>
            <div id="main-result" class="text-sm md:text-base text-text-muted mt-2 font-medium">
              <!-- English result -->
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Secondary Details Grid -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
            <div class="bg-bg-base border border-border-card p-4 rounded-2xl text-center">
              <span class="text-[0.6rem] text-text-muted block uppercase font-bold tracking-wider mb-1">एकूण महिने (Months)</span>
              <span id="stat-months" class="text-xl font-extrabold text-text-main">--</span>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-bg-base border border-border-card p-4 rounded-2xl text-center">
              <span class="text-[0.6rem] text-text-muted block uppercase font-bold tracking-wider mb-1">एकूण हप्ते (Weeks)</span>
